      "writtenOn": "2020-11-24T20:34:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No need to only save contacts in contacts db, however there is unfortunately a little bit of a backwards compatibility problem we need to solve. When bulk capability is exchanged, we will need to listen to changes in the contacts db and then internally trigger some contacts exchanges to happen if our cache has expired. we will also have to set up an alarm to trigger a bulk capability cache update when one of the contact\u0027s cached values for capability expire.\n\nThis doesn\u0027t have to be solved in this CL though, let\u0027s leave that for a follow up CL.",
